    "system": {
        "id": "synchronized-assault",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">3</span></p><p><em>You observe a weakness in your enemy’s position, then direct your squad to focus their full power on a single crucial foe.</em></p><p>Spend 2 focus to make a <strong>Leadership</strong> test against the Cognitive defense of an enemy you can sense. On a success, choose a number of allies up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong>. On a failure, choose one ally you can influence. On the next turn of each of your chosen allies, they gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">1</span> that can be spent only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.Da4Xj4WnVbtHMH7k]{Strike} against that enemy. This Strike doesn’t count against their allowed number of Strike actions for the hands holding that weapon.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">3</span></p><p>Spend 2 focus to test <strong>Leadership</strong> vs. enemy’s Cognitive. On success, allies up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong> gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">1</span> for an additional @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.Da4Xj4WnVbtHMH7k]{Strike} against the target. On failure, only one ally gains <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">1</span>.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">3</span></p><p>Spend 2 focus to make a <strong>Leadership</strong> test against the Cognitive defense of an enemy you can sense. On a success, choose a number of allies up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong>. On a failure, choose one ally you can influence. On the next turn of each of your chosen allies, they gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">1</span> that can be spent only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.Da4Xj4WnVbtHMH7k]{Strike} against that enemy. This Strike doesn’t count against their allowed number of Strike actions for the hands holding that weapon.</p>"
        },
